# Without these, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the line
# endings inside binary deliverables and silently corrupts them.
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary

# Text files are deliberately left to the local autocrlf setting.  Pinning LF
# here would renormalise every source file and make every teammate's checkout
# dirty until they run `git add --renormalize`, which is not worth the churn.
